I left out the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so it has no HTTP import, and a call to `metadata.internal.example` would be refused at the boundary as an out-of-scope reach. Sending each item's text to an external host would also leak feed content outside the graph. If the graph owner wants enrichment, they would need to grant an `http-client` scope to this node and review what data leaves.

